# WazHack/ZX CONCEPT decor tiles (docs/design/concept-screen.md §3.3) — DRAFT for user review.
# Format = tools/gfx_convert.py --mode tile: "=== name ink:<c> paper:<c> [bright]" + 8 rows
# of 8 ('#' ink, '.' paper). One paper+ink per tile, so clash-legal by construction.
# Every decor tile sits in an AIR band (black paper, F9). Animated objects list every frame.
# Attr cycles (torch, brazier flame, candles) are attr-only and live in concept_screen.py.
# The wall torch (#1) is NOT here: it reuses item_torch (existing art, 0 new ids).

